[107.339918, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ make -j8 tsan 2>&1 | tail -n 3\r\n"]
[629.829893, "o", "[doctest] test cases:     64 |     64 passed | 0 failed | 0 skipped\r\n[doctest] assertions: 978254 | 978254 passed | 0 failed |\r\n[doctest] Status: SUCCESS!\r\n"]
[631.839549, "o", "\u001b[2m# leak check: LeakSanitizer is not available on Apple silicon, so use macOS leaks(1)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[633.84872, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ leaks --atExit -- build/tests --no-intro 2>&1 | grep -E \"Status|leaks for\"\r\n"]
[697.787111, "o", "[doctest] Status: SUCCESS!\r\n"]
[699.842089, "o", "Process 38120: 0 leaks for 0 total leaked bytes.\r\n"]
[701.883368, "o", "\u001b[2m# dsl-demo: AVL tree shape after each insert (30 and 50 rotate once, 25 needs a double rotation)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[703.892127, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ build/dsl-demo avl 10 20 30 40 50 25\r\n"]
[705.023677, "o", "== AVL tree: insert 6 keys, shape after each insert\r\n   (drawn sideways: root on the left, larger keys above)\r\n\r\ninsert 10: no rotation, height 1, valid AVL: yes\r\n10\r\n\r\ninsert 20: no rotation, height 2, valid AVL: yes\r\n┌── 20\r\n10\r\n\r\ninsert 30: 1 rotation (single), height 2, valid AVL: yes\r\n┌── 30\r\n20\r\n└── 10\r\n\r\ninsert 40: no rotation, height 3, valid AVL: yes\r\n    ┌── 40\r\n┌── 30\r\n20\r\n└── 10\r\n\r\ninsert 50: 1 rotation (single), height 3, valid AVL: yes\r\n    ┌── 50\r\n┌── 40\r\n│   └── 30\r\n20\r\n└── 10\r\n\r\n"]
[705.023761, "o", "insert 25: 2 rotations (double), height 3, valid AVL: yes\r\n    ┌── 50\r\n┌── 40\r\n30\r\n│   ┌── 25\r\n└── 20\r\n    └── 10\r\n\r\nin order: {10: 10, 20: 20, 25: 25, 30: 30, 40: 40, 50: 50}\r\n"]
[707.043437, "o", "\u001b[2m# sorted input: the plain BST degenerates into a list, the AVL tree stays at height 14\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[709.055339, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ build/dsl-demo sorted 10000\r\n"]
[709.875273, "o", "\r\n== insert 1..10000 in sorted order\r\n"]
[709.97568, "o", "BinarySearchTree: height  10000  (99.3 ms)\r\nAVLTree:          height     14  (0.7 ms, 9986 rotations)\r\n"]
[711.988486, "o", "\u001b[2m# hash map (Robin Hood open addressing): every rehash, probe lengths, backward-shift erase\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[713.995095, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ build/dsl-demo hashmap 1000\r\n"]
[714.808876, "o", "\r\n== HashMap: insert 1000 keys, max load factor 0.875\r\ninsert #1      rehash     0 ->     8 buckets   load now 0.125   longest probe 1\r\ninsert #8      rehash     8 ->    16 buckets   load now 0.500   longest probe 2\r\ninsert #15     rehash    16 ->    32 buckets   load now 0.469   longest probe 3\r\ninsert #29     rehash    32 ->    64 buckets   load now 0.453   longest probe 1\r\ninsert #57     rehash    64 ->   128 buckets   load now 0.445   longest probe 2\r\ninsert #113    rehash   128 ->   256 buckets   load now 0.441   longest probe 1\r\n"]
[714.808929, "o", "insert #225    rehash   256 ->   512 buckets   load now 0.439   longest probe 2\r\ninsert #449    rehash   512 ->  1024 buckets   load now 0.438   longest probe 3\r\ninsert #897    rehash  1024 ->  2048 buckets   load now 0.438   longest probe 2\r\nfinal: 1000 keys in 2048 buckets, load 0.488, longest probe 2\r\nerased 500 keys (backward shift, no tombstones): 500 left, longest probe 1\r\nevery remaining key found, every erased key gone: yes\r\n"]
[716.815357, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ build/dsl-demo containers\r\n"]
[717.632309, "o", "\r\n== each container, printed with operator<<\r\nDynamicArray      [9, 5, 3, 8, 1]  size 5 capacity 6\r\nSinglyLinkedList  [3, 2, 1, 0]  (reversed)\r\nDoublyLinkedList  [1, 2, 3, 4]  (merge sorted)\r\nCircularBuffer    [4, 5, 6, 7]  (capacity 4, pushed 1..7)\r\nStack             [a, b, c>  top c\r\nQueue             <2, 3, 4]  front 2\r\nPriorityQueue     top 9, popped in order: 9 6 5 4 3 2 1 1\r\nHashMap           size 2, h[\"y\"] = 2\r\nAVLTree           {apple: 1, fig: 2, pear: 3}\r\n"]
[719.643647, "o", "\u001b[2m# short benchmark run vs the standard containers (-O2, n = 1k and 100k, ns per element)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[721.655665, "o", "\u001b[32mdarsh@mac\u001b[0m:\u001b[34mcpp-data-structures\u001b[0m$ build/bench --quick 2>/dev/null\r\n"]
[729.454186, "o", "| structure | operation | n = 1k | n = 100k |\r\n|---|---|--:|--:|\r\n| AVLTree / map | insert random | 60.4 / 52.6 (1.15x) | 524.0 / 468.9 (1.12x) |\r\n|  | find (hit) | 36.1 / 24.8 (1.45x) | 264.7 / 420.1 (0.63x) |\r\n|  | iterate | 5.17 / 5.50 (0.94x) | 81.5 / 115.5 (0.71x) |\r\n|  | erase all | 81.8 / 79.0 (1.04x) | 602.4 / 690.1 (0.87x) |\r\n|  | insert sorted | 45.5 / 43.2 (1.05x) | 58.0 / 62.1 (0.93x) |\r\n| BinaryHeap / priority_queue | push | 4.54 / 3.88 (1.17x) | 13.0 / 14.2 (0.92x) |\r\n|  | pop all | 19.9 / 29.1 (0.68x) | 74.9 / 83.0 (0.90x) |\r\n|  | heapify | 1.96 / 2.58 (0.76x) | 5.43 / 6.04 (0.90x) |\r\n| BinarySearchTree / map | insert random | 28.8 / 33.8 (0.85x) | 583.4 / 631.7 (0.92x) |\r\n|  | find (hit) | 44.9 / 21.4 (2.10x) | 632.6 / 273.3 (2.31x) |\r\n|  | iterate | 6.75 / 6.21 (1.09x) | 112.3 / 87.5 (1.28x) |\r\n|  | erase all | 69.0 / 65.7 (1.05x) | 725.7 / 610.0 (1.19x) |\r\n|  | insert sorted | 714.4 / 46.6 (15.34x) | |\r\n| DoublyLinkedList / list | push_back | 11.6 / 11.6 (1.00x) | 15.2 / 15.1 (1.01x) |\r\n|  |"]
[729.455427, "o", " iterate | 1.50 / 1.46 (1.03x) | 2.47 / 2.71 (0.91x) |\r\n|  | erase every 2nd | 24.0 / 22.8 (1.05x) | 23.2 / 21.5 (1.08x) |\r\n"]
[729.456114, "o", "|  | sort | 21.2 / 21.0 (1.01x) | 318.6 / 262.6 (1.21x) |\r\n| DynamicArray / vector | push_back | 3.38 / 1.42 (2.38x) | 4.46 / 1.21 (3.70x) |\r\n|  | push_back (by ref) | 3.38 / 4.38 (0.77x) | 5.93 / 6.49 (0.91x) |\r\n|  | iterate | 0.12 / 0.12 (1.00x) | 0.22 / 0.21 (1.04x) |\r\n|  | insert front | 237.5 / 233.8 (1.02x) | 48567.2 / 48438.2 (1.00x) |\r\n| HashMap / unordered_map | insert | 35.0 / 52.5 (0.67x) | 112.5 / 212.3 (0.53x) |\r\n|  | insert (reserved) | 11.1 / 30.5 (0.36x) | 53.3 / 142.8 (0.37x) |\r\n|  | find (hit) | 2.75 / 8.08 (0.34x) | 33.4 / 65.0 (0.51x) |\r\n|  | find (miss) | 2.33 / 17.0 (0.14x) | 31.9 / 76.1 (0.42x) |\r\n|  | iterate | 2.00 / 2.21 (0.91x) | 3.17 / 77.0 (0.04x) |\r\n|  | erase all | 3.29 / 53.8 (0.06x) | 34.5 / 327.9 (0.11x) |\r\n| Queue / std::queue | push+pop | 3.42 / 2.29 (1.49x) | 3.58 / 2.23 (1.60x) |\r\n|  | push+pop (by ref) | 7.08 / 2.04 (3.47x) | 3.80 / 2.21 (1.72x) |\r\n| SinglyLinkedList / forward_list | push_front | 11.5 / 11.2 (1.02x) | 12.1 / 12.8 (0.94x) |\r\n"]
